  "disclaimer": "本文件只是候选参考稿，不是本项目的正式 L0 原文。只有主编对照底本实物签字之后，才能把对应条目录入 inputs/human/11-tai-canonical.csv，由 gxwd texts import 写入 data/canonical-texts.json。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text_id": "H11-gua_ci",
      "text_type": "gua_ci",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "泰：小往大来，吉亨。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-tuan",
      "text_type": "tuan",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "泰，小往大来，吉亨。则是天地交而万物通也，上下交而其志同也。内阳而外阴，内健而外顺，内君子而外小人，君子道长，小人道消也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-da_xiang",
      "text_type": "da_xiang",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "天地交，泰。后以财成天地之道，辅相天地之宜，以左右民。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-yao_ci-L1",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": "初九",
      "candidate_text": "拔茅茹，以其汇，征吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-yao_ci-L2",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": "九二",
      "candidate_text": "包荒，用冯河，不遐遗，朋亡，得尚于中行。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-yao_ci-L3",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": "九三",
      "candidate_text": "无平不陂，无往不复，艰贞无咎。勿恤其孚，于食有福。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-yao_ci-L4",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": "六四",
      "candidate_text": "翩翩，不富以其邻，不戒以孚。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-yao_ci-L5",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": "六五",
      "candidate_text": "帝乙归妹，以祉元吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-yao_ci-L6",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": "上六",
      "candidate_text": "城复于隍，勿用师。自邑告命，贞吝。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-xiao_xiang-L1",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“拔茅征吉”，志在外也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-xiao_xiang-L2",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“包荒”，“得尚于中行”，以光大也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-xiao_xiang-L3",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“无往不复”，天地际也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-xiao_xiang-L4",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“翩翩不富”，皆失实也；“不戒以孚”，中心愿也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-xiao_xiang-L5",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“以祉元吉”，中以行愿也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H11-xiao_xiang-L6",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“城复于隍”，其命乱也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    }
  ]
}
